    <title>[影视一谈]谢谢你提升我的电影品味，亲爱的韦斯安德森</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66285b03c3e09d8f370e334d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66285b03c3e09d8f370e334d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 Apr 2024 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目主要讲述的是韦斯安德森的风格特点和个人作品发展各阶段的特点。但是没有涉及到韦斯安德森每部电影的具体剧情和深度剖析每部电影的内容，这个是希望留在后面做一个关于韦斯安德森的作品系列（是的，又要开系列）。下面的电影海报来自豆瓣。</span></p><span></span><p><span>韦斯安德森</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft62kDiNu8xEd9dKEMRNyLoYZRe-.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>欧文威尔逊</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrsnnmuwAk5y7BDnaBqMOdC8s3bJ.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>瓶装火箭</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq8pTkiMyYahMBO_eLB4maNHEwbA.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>《布达佩斯大饭店》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjMZNspyZKRH0RhKJWA9z2wnZMPw.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>《了不起的狐狸爸爸》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiIB8SPvow76RVp8POi_OCoqoHsI.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>《法兰西特派》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl__I7zHkfWuhdL8l4_g0vO3uYKG.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>《亨利休格的神奇故事》《毒》《捕鼠人》《天鹅》（罗尔德短片四部曲）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrcRV_zUeofWsGUhpWcJ5pc59RDQ.webp"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqnDjFd9EWqhk9vLhYqxfNLlMDBJ.webp"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft5FhG6PIPnZxWC6dmRST5Sk7vPc.webp"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvhcHuWzXtu1tqNUFHlw1LLWe_PG.webp"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>时间线</span></strong></p><span></span><h1><strong><span>第一部分：早年生活与艺术启蒙</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="494">08:14</a>&nbsp;</span></h1><span></span><h1><strong><span>第二部分：电影生涯的开端</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1009">16:49</a>&nbsp;</span></h1><span></span><h1><strong><span>第三部分：标志性风格的发展</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a>&nbsp;</span></h1><span></span><p><strong><span>第四部分：主题与叙事</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">28:22</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><h1><strong><span>第五部分：动画电影的尝试</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1994">33:14</a>&nbsp;</span></h1><span></span><p><strong><span>第六部分：《布达佩斯大饭店》的巅峰之作</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2547">42:27</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>第七部分：《法兰西特派》与新闻业的情书</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3035">50:35</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><h1><strong><span>第八部分：合作与演员阵容</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3568">59:28</a>&nbsp;</span></h1><span></span><p><span>如果大家对电影相关的话题感兴趣，还请大家多多订阅和评论！</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你有想法和建议，我们也非常期待你的来信！</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱地址：</span><a href="mailto:yw18zuel@qq.com"><u><span>yw18zuel@qq.com</span></u></a></p>]]></description>
